    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d967">

                <pb facs="0896" n="806" sameAs="frus:frus1918Russiav02/pg806"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 860d.00/255</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Consul at
                        Helsingfors</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Haynes</hi>)<anchor n="2"
                        xml:id="d967-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1918-08-23T16:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">August 23,
                                1918, 4 p.m.</hi></date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your 73. Department concurs in your opinion and commends your judgment that any
                    action or consultations relative to recognition of <hi rendition="#italic">de
                        facto</hi> government should be deferred until situation is more clearly
                    defined than at present.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi></signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
